84
00:06:06,760 --> 00:06:07,590
I...

85
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:12,906
Fine, just keep quiet
and stay out of the way.

86
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:13,870
Quiet and...

87
00:06:13,953 --> 00:06:15,546
By the way, my name's Kirito.

88
00:06:15,740 --> 00:06:17,977
Looks like we're a party
until we make that sword.

89
00:06:18,060 --> 00:06:19,540
Yeah, whatever, Kirito.

90
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:22,995
Well, if you're gonna be like
that, I can roll with it.

91
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:24,640
Lisbeth?

92
