93
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:36,780
It's cold.

94
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:39,777
Well, you should have
brought a coat or something.

95
00:06:39,860 --> 00:06:43,272
I didn't know Floor 55 was
going to be this freaking cold.

96
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:49,955
Are you going to be okay without this?

97
00:06:50,180 --> 00:06:52,651
You don't feel cold if you're disciplined.

98
00:06:53,140 --> 00:06:55,846
If you're trying to piss
me off, it's working.

99
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,499
