131
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:06,202
You've got it right where you...

132
00:09:10,320 --> 00:09:11,150
Liz! Liz!

133
00:09:22,020 --> 00:09:23,320
Hang on to me, Liz!

134
00:09:24,340 --> 00:09:25,170
Ahhhhh!

135
00:09:40,080 --> 00:09:41,660
Aren't we still alive?

136
00:09:44,320 --> 00:09:46,180
Yeah, it looks like it.

137
00:09:48,580 --> 00:09:50,462
Drink one of these just in case.

138
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:05,137
